WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:03.505
Collection requested.
Equipment still on site.

00:00:03.605 --> 00:00:09.115
Nepsis shows why a working demo is not a handoff—
and what the team needs before takeover.

00:00:09.905 --> 00:00:11.943
But the screen is
not the workflow.

00:00:12.022 --> 00:00:14.183
The team first needs
clear states.

00:00:14.326 --> 00:00:19.002
Ready for collection means site use has finished.
Collection requested means the supplier was contacted.

00:00:19.062 --> 00:00:25.722
Collected means the machine has physically left.
Supplier confirmation received is another state.

00:00:25.782 --> 00:00:32.888
The relevant terms and confirmations still need checking;
a button does not decide them.
